<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Kadir &Ouml;ZKAYA</span></p>
</div>
</td>
<td style="width: 33.333333333333336%; padding: 1pt 6pt; border: none; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">
