<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Başkanvekili </span></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Basri BAĞCI</span></p>
</div>
</td>
